0..77 Comment "// A program hands the host a checkpoint whose certificate evidence is false,"
78..152 Comment "// and `restore` refuses it. `gandr run false-checkpoint.gandr` writes the"
153..229 Comment "// refusal as one line on standard error. The run stops at `restore`, and it"
230..248 Comment "// prints nothing."
249..251 Comment "//"
252..330 Comment "// The text is the checkpoint of a machine on `sqrt 2 < 3/2` after two quanta,"
331..401 Comment "// one for each pole, except for one byte. The first step of each pole"
402..478 Comment "// witnesses the cut of `sqrt 2`: `1` lies in its lower cut, and `2` lies in"
479..553 Comment "// its upper cut. The text moves the lower point of the pole that holds to"
554..632 Comment "// `3`, which does not lie in the lower cut. The bytes stay canonical, and the"
633..697 Comment "// checker finds the false point only when it replays the steps."
698..700 Comment "//"
701..778 Comment "// `restore` validates the plan again and replays the steps again. It refuses"
779..831 Comment "// the checkpoint at step 0 by the check `NotLower`."
832..834 Comment "//"
835..908 Comment "// - see: `corpus/model/reals/resume.gandr` — a checkpoint that resumes"
909..988 Comment "// - see: `crates/theory-exact-reals/src/dovetail.rs` — the checkpoint of the"
989..1003 Comment "//   scheduler"
1005..1037 Comment "// The console\'s host interface."
